6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  70)          \
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  71)          WHEN TO REACH FOR WHICH KIND:\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  72)          • Rows/columns of data → 'table' (NEVER markdown pipe tables).\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  73)          • Task/status board → 'kanban'. Collecting input → 'form' (then component_wait).\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  74)          • A running task → 'progress'. A multi-step plan → 'timeline'.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  75)          • KPIs / metrics (views, plays, saves) → 'stat'. Numeric series to visualize → 'chart'.\n\
fae71b0f (John Smathers   2026-07-16 00:06:56 -0400  76)          • A graph users should explore by changing numeric parameters → 'interactive_plot'.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  77)          • Project structure / file list → 'file_tree'. Showing code edits → 'diff'.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  78)          • A code snippet to copy → 'code'. An important note/warning → 'callout'.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  79)          • Images / screenshots / generated art → 'gallery'. A yes/no before something \
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  80)          destructive → 'confirm' (then component_wait for the answer).\n\
0ba80449 (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-31 00:33:10 -0400  81)          • Anything geographic — locations, routes, where creators/streams/markets are → \
0ba80449 (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-31 00:33:10 -0400  82)          'map' (a live, pannable Google Map). Far better than describing coordinates in text.\n\
0ba80449 (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-31 00:33:10 -0400  83)          • A video to watch inline — a TikTok/Reel/YouTube link, or a direct video file → \
0ba80449 (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-31 00:33:10 -0400  84)          'video' (embeds and plays in the chat). Use for campaign clips, sound previews, references.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  85)          • Several of the above at once → 'dashboard'. Long prose → 'markdown' (or plain text).\n\
01cc78d1 (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 00:41:30 -0400  86)          \
01cc78d1 (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 00:41:30 -0400  87)          PROPS SCHEMA BY KIND (props must match exactly):\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  88)          • table — { columns: [\"Name\",\"Status\"], rows: [[\"Fix login\",\"open\"],[\"Add tests\",\"done\"]] }. Emits row_clicked { row_index }.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  89)          • kanban — { columns: [{id,title}], cards: [{id, column, title, description?}] }. Emits card_clicked.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  90)          • form — { title, fields: [{name, label, type, required?, options?}], submit_label? }. type is text|textarea|select|number. Emits form_submit { <name>: value }.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  91)          • progress — { label, value, max, indeterminate? }. value/max numbers (0.6/1.0). Display only.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  92)          • markdown — { content: \"## md\" }. Rich prose; supports tables, bold, lists.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  93)          • dashboard — { children: [{ id, width, kind?, props? }] }. Grid; width is fr units; inline kind+props renders that component in the cell.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  94)          • chart — { title?, type: \"bar\"|\"line\", series: [{label, value}] }. value is numeric. Display only.\n\
fae71b0f (John Smathers   2026-07-16 00:06:56 -0400  95)          • interactive_plot — { title?, description?, parameters: [{id,label?,min,max,step?,value,unit?}], plot: {x:{id?,label?,min,max,samples?}, y_label?, series:[{label,expression}]}, metrics?:[{label,expression,unit?,precision?}] }. Parameter/x ids are lowercase ASCII. Bounded to 12 parameters, 6 series, 12 metrics, 512 samples, and 512 expression characters; controls recompute locally and emit parameters_changed on commit.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  96)          • timeline — { steps: [{label, status: \"done\"|\"active\"|\"pending\"|\"error\", detail?}] }. Re-render with replace:true to advance.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  97)          • stat — { stats: [{label, value, delta?, trend: \"up\"|\"down\"|\"flat\"}] }. value is string or number.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  98)          • file_tree — { root?, entries: [{name, type: \"file\"|\"dir\", path?, children?}] }. Dirs nest via children. Files emit file_clicked { path }.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400  99)          • diff — { filename?, lines: [{kind: \"add\"|\"del\"|\"ctx\", text}] }  OR  { filename?, unified: \"+new\\n-old\" }.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400 100)          • code — { language?, filename?, code }. Renders a copy-able code block.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400 101)          • callout — { variant: \"info\"|\"success\"|\"warn\"|\"error\", title?, body? }. body supports markdown.\n\
6d87aeff (Risingtides-dev 2026-05-30 18:16:31 -0400 102)          • gallery — { images: [{src, caption?}] }. src is a URL or data: URI.\n\
