827b65bc (John Smathers   2026-07-15 03:40:14 -0400 72)             }
827b65bc (John Smathers   2026-07-15 03:40:14 -0400 73)         }
827b65bc (John Smathers   2026-07-15 03:40:14 -0400 74)         let tool: Arc<crate::tools::todo::TodoTool> = Arc::new(crate::tools::todo::TodoTool::new());
